{
  "_about": [
    "MANO COLONY v2 asset list (the 13 sheets in ./originals-v2, never edited).",
    "scripts/colony-assets.py cleans each sheet without hardening it (solid insides stay, soft",
    "edges keep their alpha, only noise away from the drawings is removed), cuts every object",
    "by its own pixels and the grid cell its centre falls in (or an explicit box where two",
    "drawings touch), and packs one atlas per sheet into src/colony/assets/.",
    "w: width of the drawing in the game, in world px (1 floor tile = 64 x 32).",
    "anchor: 'feet' = bottom of the drawing, centred on the head (Mano frames);",
    "'base' = bottom centre; [x, y] = an exact source pixel (e.g. a fence post's foot)."
  ],
